---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Imprint | Triarc"
  description="Imprint and contact details for Triarc — hospitality software from St. Gallen, Switzerland."
  lang="en"
  crumb="Imprint"
  altHref="/impressum"
>
  <main id="main" class="legal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>Imprint<span class="stop">.</span></h1>
    <p class="lede">Information under Swiss law. Triarc is a venture run by Manuel Bänziger, based in St. Gallen.</p>

    <section class="lblock">
      <h2>Responsible / Owner</h2>
      <address>
        <p>Manuel Bänziger</p>
        <p>Triarc</p>
        <p>St. Gallen, Switzerland</p>
        <p>Contact: <a class="link" href="mailto:manuel@triarc.ch">manuel@triarc.ch</a></p>
      </address>
    </section>

    <section class="lblock">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Email: <a class="link" href="mailto:manuel@triarc.ch">manuel@triarc.ch</a></p>
      <p>Web: <a class="link" href="https://triarc.ch">triarc.ch</a></p>
    </section>

    <section class="lblock">
      <h2>Legal form</h2>
      <p>Sole proprietorship (Einzelfirma)</p>
    </section>

    <section class="lblock">
      <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>The content of this website has been compiled with care. No guarantee is given for its accuracy, completeness or timeliness. Descriptions of individual instruments reflect their respective stage of development; the feature set may change.</p>
      <p>The operators of external linked sites are solely responsible for their content.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="lblock">
      <h2>Image credit</h2>
      <p>Alpstein massif with the Säntis on the home page: <a class="link" href="https://unsplash.com/photos/V7EgUtCnvLY" rel="noopener">Pascal Debrunner</a> via Unsplash (Unsplash License).</p>
    </section>

    <section class="lblock">
      <h2>Data protection</h2>
      <p>Information on the processing of personal data can be found in the <a class="link" href="/en/datenschutz">privacy policy</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal { width: min(760px, calc(100% - 56px)); margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 0; }
  .eyebrow { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.34em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); margin: 0 0 16px; }
  h1 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 300; font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 68px); line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin: 0 0 8px; }
  h1 .stop { color: var(--gold); }
  .lede { font-size: 16.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 44rem; margin: 0 0 48px; padding-bottom: 40px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .lblock { padding: 0 0 36px; }
  .lblock h2 { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-soft); font-weight: 400; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .lblock p, .lblock address { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--ink); font-style: normal; }
  .link { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gold); padding-bottom: 1px; transition: color 180ms ease; }
  .link:hover { color: var(--gold); }
</style>
